#: scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 740ef9b3b893529a470fa299017c45457b17bd2a31ae3593331ad38b47b110ce
