msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why’d you tell him that, anyway?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫なんでそんなこと、⟪k:3⟫言ったんですか？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61e3adc92b740b63549b1bafecba0d0fc52631f686b3142d1af92398d2283f77
#. default-sha256: eee212df097265572ca866b7233a43b3b0ffb1cd7320fb6ccadd33408d909d40
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know, I know!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Besides, you have every intention of keeping your "
"promise, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫分かってますって！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫それに、⟪k:5⟫嘘にするつもりはないんでしょう？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aac39872911166684efbb38b09a4a293f29c9500be4d7610fe5ebbc14b62f238
#. default-sha256: 917dd0015dbe26d60ab09612ff630ea1237a3d05846fa18d127cf4e8b7cae233
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe, oh, you. You say it’s all on him,⟪k:3⟫but deep down, you know you’re on "
"his side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ふふー、⟪k:3⟫そう言って、⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫本当は放っておけない気持ちなんじゃないですか？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03185c39c072b3b99d801ef00ffc7502931c41c85b2715d53f9b4ffd93e03536
#. default-sha256: 8999d098d18857268108e0b279edcfc55dc6b81ce17a9ac85e0db6a37244ca8a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re complete strangers to this Mell,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but I can’t bring myself to think "
"of him that way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫わたしも、⟪k:3⟫彼のことを赤の他人とは思えないんです。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫今の時代の彼にしてみ"
"たら、⟪k:6⟫わたしたちは初対面ですけど……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eddf8b7641dfef5307a1f0f21407df11ee72464ee5e802fa573c888db11f54af
#. default-sha256: 43baca5b9e0ac4612ee313462fa6ec2fa9274b77371c8d879eb969991530bb2d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And you were actually there—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a part of his life—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫which I "
"imagine makes the sentiment all the stronger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫君は彼の人生に関わっていたのだから……、⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫なおさらそう思うのかもしれない"
"な……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 168a06aa0cf26dc52da6f166d6cb09c1780541e724fceee17cf71e1d5a1e2f44
#. default-sha256: f61d86d351962123a0013e7674464fc06faecd35f54e91e6507d7b4844b2f97b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫don’t think of him... ⟪k:3⟫as a total stranger, no.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫However..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫赤の他人とは……、⟪k:3⟫同じように思ってはいない。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫しかし……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acddded9655c1627c9e82c09847f0ba1a1fbeea9d1d9fad4153dea0475abfea4
#. default-sha256: 0d8d65f164f078c232dae27701cf75d7548c2b52b8e6eaa376a95cb242cafc4f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s hard to say... ⟪k:3⟫but even if he doesn’t,⟪k:4⟫we still have the other two "
"men to worry about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫どうかな……。⟪k:3⟫あいつに度胸がなかったとしても、⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫他の二人がいる。⟪k:6⟫手"
"を下すのは彼でなくてもいい。"

