#: scenario8:scenario8_456D304C_18F8_49FE_B699_BB8FB0129127
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23d2b768509b29f812cef376d80bc874db82c4cea35043dc0ebd56ba7820c1a4
