msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But we have knowledge—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫quite a bit of it, in fact."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ただ……知っていることは、⟪k:3⟫むしろ多いと思うのです。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4679173ae1d0f9c5c70f12a882159a619f943db0e53ac12f0df85695dc52ff60
#. default-sha256: c11b110f177edd5a1dd5fa1629c43bc81f7a45e7e694a8c563ac48f6ea0be36c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I agree! If his darling sister tells him to stop,⟪k:3⟫he won’t have any reason to "
"continue his involvement!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫そうですよ！　⟪k:3⟫大事にしている妹から、⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「止めて」って言われたら、⟪k:6⟫"
"こんなこと意味ないですもの！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebcd20a4da1fcc0a7e0d6d265496068e0effa4f5caec0c8741c57e3846782a09
#. default-sha256: df8640ed8bbcc374ffc46abd4ae6782d38bd8f12341e2cbe5c5cc043bbb1de06
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫is that people tend to keep those they care most about close by."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫大事にしている子なら、⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫傍に置いておくはず……ってことだったんです。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af7b992671ee8507634c2c88b1a834afb33112bf92aeb7b4149c857cf21138c3
