msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(It would appear I have a bad tendency to focus too much on the facts.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（どうにも私の考え方は、⟪k:2⟫事実だけを追ってしまう）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_837E4EB5_6197_46D7_B145_2F8C50D9FDE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0caf066db0361689ff7ed1e84cedec65b30930b05857cfb5604e28fc12a4b5c4
