#: scenario8:scenario8_2EB39580_FF7B_4387_B185_A520655DDDAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 628af9c408998203a426856e07da9a9678ebaff2329c3e9f9caf673e38340df7
#. default-sha256: af2fc51f52445cfc0f1f2dd4d5331a1ac68a4b71b55ac4f79cd8852f47cf65be
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2EB39580_FF7B_4387_B185_A520655DDDAA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We’ll probably have more luck asking than just searching for her. ⟪k:2⟫If we can’t find "
"Mell, the nun might know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫闇雲に捜すより、⟪k:2⟫人に聞いた方が良さそうです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫メルが見つからなかったら、"
"⟪k:5⟫修道女に聞きましょう。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_49B91D93_C7F9_4BB2_B3FC_8873EEEDA737
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24c822da16ef36278cbbde329d8bf4c6661ada8d01d7753b9d2b78358a5007b1
#. default-sha256: c33c4b3507d44d79aa9421cb1aba210d77b4ec29fb1eac4e291fda4751b293a1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_49B91D93_C7F9_4BB2_B3FC_8873EEEDA737"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The man is practically beaming, and judging by the vial in his hand,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫老人に顔には幸福そうな笑みが浮かんでいる。⟪k:1⟫その笑みが意図するところは、⟪k:2⟫修道女に対す"
"る信頼や信仰だけでないのだろう。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4A9271DD_A8CC_4C84_AD1C_5E56EA43DC0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58761267e87f5a261a961e3c5b710c6516c8de6c35661a6b90c77d2a06fc6ae9
#. default-sha256: f3a64e816a3bcc86f4bdd0d97e59a2b08b2ee7f931eaf6bd1e2fe3e161234cd3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4A9271DD_A8CC_4C84_AD1C_5E56EA43DC0A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We come from the future, so we know just how dangerous this is..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫わたしたちは、⟪k:3⟫この先の時代も知ってしまったから……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫この行いがどれほど危"
"ないものか分かっているけれど……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E3C4D349_6165_42E5_9315_528017A9ED61
